        <description>claude-pet update feed</description>
        <language>en</language>
        <!--
            One-time setup (owner only):
            a. Run Sparkle's generate_keys (private key is stored in your login Keychain)
            b. Replace SUPublicEDKey in ClaudePet/Info.plist with the printed public key
               (the current key belongs to the upstream project; updates can't be signed until it's swapped)

            To publish a new release:
            1. Build, sign, notarize, staple the app
            2. Create zip: ditto -c -k - -keepParent claude-pet.app claude-pet-vX.Y.zip
            3. Sign for Sparkle: sign_update claude-pet-vX.Y.zip
            4. Add a new <item> below with the edSignature and length
            5. Upload zip to GitHub Releases (github.com/freyzo/claude-pet)
            6. Commit appcast.xml and push to main (the app reads it from raw.githubusercontent.com)
        -->
    </channel>
</rss>
